# GitHub Linguist Overrides
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md

# 1. Exclude HTML templates from language statistics
# Prevents template markup and presentation files from dominating backend Python code
*.html linguist-detectable=false
templates/** linguist-vendored
**/templates/** linguist-vendored

# 2. Mark static frontend assets, vendor libraries, and mock data as vendored
static/assets/** linguist-vendored
static/libs/** linguist-vendored
static/css/** linguist-vendored
static/js/mock/** linguist-vendored
static/** linguist-vendored

# 3. Explicitly detect Python code as the primary project language
*.py linguist-detectable=true
